The  program  is  used  to mount a file hierarchy served with the
Plan 9 resource sharing protocol 9P.  After the  file  system  is
mounted,  the files on the remote will be accessed using the cre‐
dentials of the user named and whatever UID the user  happens  to
have  on  the  remote  server.  If is supplied, it is used as the
mount rootpath on the remote host.  must  be  an  absolute  path.
The  host  name  may  be  optionally enclosed in square brackets.
